// Dev-контейнер x86_64 (см. Dockerfile). Открыть: VSCodium → «Dev Containers: Reopen in Container»
// или вручную: docker build --platform linux/amd64 -t bebeberloga-dev -f .devcontainer/Dockerfile .
{
  "name": "bebeberloga-x86_64",
  "build": {
    "dockerfile": "Dockerfile",
    "context": "..",
    "options": ["--platform=linux/amd64"]
  },
  "runArgs": ["--platform=linux/amd64"],
  "remoteUser": "dev",
  "workspaceFolder": "/workspaces/bebeberloga",
  "workspaceMount": "source=${localWorkspaceFolder},target=/workspaces/bebeberloga,type=bind",
  "mounts": [
    "source=bebeberloga-cargo-registry,target=/home/dev/.cargo/registry,type=volume",
    "source=bebeberloga-target,target=/workspaces/bebeberloga/spikes/01-openmls-ffi/target,type=volume"
  ],
  "postCreateCommand": "mise trust && mise install -y && lefthook install || true",
  "customizations": {
    "vscode": {
      "extensions": ["rust-lang.rust-analyzer", "golang.go", "skellock.just"]
    }
  }
}
